  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of Dakar-Saint Louis Highway</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will boost the economic development and reinforce the national cohesion and the regional integration.

The main project objectives are:

- Promote economic development in particular, mining, agriculture, fishing, trade and tourism

- Reduce disparities in transport infrastructure and improve social well-being

- Develop exchanges between Senegal, North Africa and ECOWAS

- Reduce the cost of transporting people and goods;

- Ensure the safety of road users.</narrative>
  </description>
